{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-01-05 10:00:00', 'title': "HII DEMONSTRATES OPEN ARCHITECTURE AUTONOMY INTEGRATION CAPABILITY WITH SEA MACHINES' SM300", 'text': "NEWPORT NEWS, VA., JAN. 05, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES' (NYSE:HII) TECHNICAL SOLUTIONS DIVISION ANNOUNCED TODAY THE SUCCESSFUL INTEGRATION OF ITS ADVANCED AUTONOMY SOLUTIONS WITH SEA MACHINES ROBOTICS' SM300 AUTONOMY PRODUCT. THE INTEGRATION OF THESE AUTONOMOUS CAPABILITIES SUPPORTS COMPLEX MISSION PLANNING AND COLLABORATION BETWEEN UNMANNED SYSTEMS."}